OL,3,GNEWSATeenager who injured police
OL,4,Aofficer in brick attack given community
OL,5,Apayback order
OL,6,
OL,7,FA teenager who left a police officer
OL,8,Fwith a head injury after throwing a
OL,9,Fbrick at a police van during a
OL,10,FHalloween night riot in Edinburgh has
OL,11,Fbeen ordered to pay the constable
OL,12,Fcompensation.
OL,14,FKieran Sutherland left the officer
OL,15,Fpermanently scarred and suffering from
OL,16,Fpsychological issues after throwing the
OL,17,Frock through the window of the vehicle
OL,18,Fduring the incident in the Niddrie area
OL,19,Fof the capital in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
