OL,3,GNEWSATeenager who injured police
OL,4,Aofficer in brick attack given community
OL,5,Apayback order
OL,6,
OL,7,FSutherland, 19, was ordered to carry
OL,8,Fout 300 hours of unpaid work and was
OL,9,Fplaced on a 20-month supervision order.
OL,11,FHe was also ordered to pay the officer
OL,12,F#1,000 during the hearing at Edinburgh
OL,13,FSheriff Court after previously
OL,14,Fadmitting a charge of culpable and
OL,15,Freckless conduct.
